    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>Your enemies do not escape easily.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base Attack Bonus\">Base Attack Bonus</a> +5</p><p><b>Effect:</b> When taking this Feat, select a single <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapon_(Melee)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Exotic Weapon (Melee)\">Exotic Weapon (Melee)</a> or melee weapon group with which you are proficient. When wielding that chosen <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapon_(Melee)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Exotic Weapon (Melee)\">Exotic Weapon (Melee)</a> or melee weapon from the chosen group, adjacent opponents may not <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Withdraw\" title=\"Withdraw\">Withdraw</a> from squares you threaten. They may still make <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Acrobatics\" title=\"Acrobatics\">Acrobatics</a> checks to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Tumble\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tumble\">Tumble</a> as normal.</p>",
